e forgotten trials -playful, puzzling, sometimes perilous- meant to be braved with friends and fellow wanderers to fuel the world with musical energy and push back the surrounding fog. Because in Majjam, every journey is richer when shared\u2026</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>","developers":["Opus Major"],"genres":[{"description":"Adventure","id":"25"},{"description":"Massively Multiplayer","id":"29"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3845650/6f77f6d482fcac4851e074042787965400dd8c1e/header.jpg?t=1758789940","is_free":false,"legal_notice":"\u00a9 Opus Major 2025","linux_requirements":[],"mac_requirements":[],"movies":[{"dash_av1":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3845650/734252416/4fa3bc6beaf6c1ceba4051bf8d9f4b7c3ee45fc2/1758545389/dash_av1.mpd?t=1758789939","dash_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3845650/734252416/4fa3bc6beaf6c1ceba4051bf8d9f4b7c3ee45fc2/1758545389/dash_h264.mpd?t=1758789939","highlight":true,"hls_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3845650/734252416/4fa3bc6beaf6c1ceba4051bf8d9f4b7c3ee45fc2/1758545389/hls_264_master.m3u8?t=1758789939","id":257203973,"name":"MAJJAM - Early Gameplay Trailer","thumbnail":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/257203973/707188bae35ef44947c111a9c4744afda50ef1a7/movie_600x337.jpg?t=1758789939"},{"dash_av1":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3845650/282398292/26f10d8a79eabdea2abc2af4ea67845712e17f3a/1751982304/dash_av1.mpd?t=1751986612","dash_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3845650/282398292/26f10d8a79eabdea2abc2af4ea67845712e17f3a/1751982304/dash_h264.mpd?t=1751986612","highlight":true,"hls_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3845650/282398292/26f10d8a79eabdea2abc2af4ea67845712e17f3a/1751982304/hls_264_master.m3u8?t=1751986612","id":257166509,"name":"MAJJAM - Reveal Trailer","thumbnail":"https://shared.akamai